{
    "title": "Soluna: Gen Z Mental Health",
    "description": "Offering confidential mental health support for 13- to 25-year-olds in California and Illinois, Soluna is your space to be you.\r\n\r\nDesigned as your personal cosmos of self-support, peer support, and professional support, Soluna offers interactive tools, peer connection, and 1:1 live support to help you help yourself in whatever way feels right \u2013 all for free.\r\n\r\nNo cost. No ads. No pressure. Just a dedicated space to wander, learn, and connect \u2013 with complete anonymity.\r\n\r\nWhat will you find in the Soluna universe to support your mental health journey? Here\u2019s a quick look:\r\n\r\nINTERACTIVE TOOLS\r\n\u2022 Quizzes: Learn more about yourself, your health, and what you need\r\n\u2022 Mood Log: Record and explore your emotional patterns\r\n\u2022 Goals: Set and track meaningful goals to support your wellbeing\r\n\u2022 Free Write: Destress and process feelings in your own digital journal\r\n\u2022 Starboard: Draw peacefully through tricky emotions when you can\u2019t find the words\r\n\u2022 Let It Out: Vent anger, unload worries, and whisper secrets \u2014 and then release them into space\r\n\u2022 Thought Shaker: Boost confidence with self-love scripts and positive affirmations\r\n\u2022 Breathwork: Breathe out anxiety and breathe in calm with easy-to-follow animations\r\n\u2022 Noise Cleanse: Tap into sound frequencies to destress, improve sleep, and hone focus\r\n\r\n1:1 PROFESSIONAL SUPPORT\r\n\u2022 Gain instant access to a team of professional coaches\r\n\u2022 Choose to schedule a session or just drop in\r\n\u2022 Chat about goals, problems, feelings, or wellbeing tips\r\n\u2022 Learn about mental health services in your area\r\n\r\nPEER CONNECTION\r\n\u2022 Share your unique perspective in anonymous polls\r\n\u2022 Express yourself through thought-provoking community prompts\r\n\u2022 Join live events hosted by experts in the mental health community\r\n\u2022 Connect with others on their mental health journeys\r\n\r\nCONSTELLATIONS\r\n\u2022 Travel through themed constellations like Living With Anxiety, Finding Calm, and Discovering Self to find the support that feels right for you\r\n\u2022 Hop from star to star to get a sampling of what each constellation has to offer in any order, at any pace\r\n\u2022 Explore text chats, quizzes, videos, swipeable articles, and more\r\n\r\nWhatever's going on in your world \u2013 school or work anxiety, body image issues, family drama, or any of life\u2019s other surprises \u2013 Soluna provides you the space and tools to journey back to yourself.\r\n\r\nYou'll never be asked to make in-app purchases, sign up for a subscription, or tolerate any (annoying) ads. Your only job is to explore your space to the fullest.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to moving towards wellness with you here in Soluna \u2013 completely free to download and 100% anonymous. Always.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Offering confidential mental health support for 13- to 25-year-olds in California and Illinois, Soluna is your space to be you.<br><br>Designed as your personal cosmos of self-support, peer support, and professional support, Soluna offers interactive tools, peer connection, and 1:1 live support to help you help yourself in whatever way feels right \u2013 all for free.<br><br>No cost. No ads. No pressure. Just a dedicated space to wander, learn, and connect \u2013 with complete anonymity.<br><br>What will you find in the Soluna universe to support your mental health journey? Here\u2019s a quick look:<br><br>INTERACTIVE TOOLS<br>\u2022 Quizzes: Learn more about yourself, your health, and what you need<br>\u2022 Mood Log: Record and explore your emotional patterns<br>\u2022 Goals: Set and track meaningful goals to support your wellbeing<br>\u2022 Free Write: Destress and process feelings in your own digital journal<br>\u2022 Starboard: Draw peacefully through tricky emotions when you can\u2019t find the words<br>\u2022 Let It Out: Vent anger, unload worries, and whisper secrets \u2014 and then release them into space<br>\u2022 Thought Shaker: Boost confidence with self-love scripts and positive affirmations<br>\u2022 Breathwork: Breathe out anxiety and breathe in calm with easy-to-follow animations<br>\u2022 Noise Cleanse: Tap into sound frequencies to destress, improve sleep, and hone focus<br><br>1:1 PROFESSIONAL SUPPORT<br>\u2022 Gain instant access to a team of professional coaches<br>\u2022 Choose to schedule a session or just drop in<br>\u2022 Chat about goals, problems, feelings, or wellbeing tips<br>\u2022 Learn about mental health services in your area<br><br>PEER CONNECTION<br>\u2022 Share your unique perspective in anonymous polls<br>\u2022 Express yourself through thought-provoking community prompts<br>\u2022 Join live events hosted by experts in the mental health community<br>\u2022 Connect with others on their mental health journeys<br><br>CONSTELLATIONS<br>\u2022 Travel through themed constellations like Living With Anxiety, Finding Calm, and Discovering Self to find the support that feels right for you<br>\u2022 Hop from star to star to get a sampling of what each constellation has to offer in any order, at any pace<br>\u2022 Explore text chats, quizzes, videos, swipeable articles, and more<br><br>Whatever&#39;s going on in your world \u2013 school or work anxiety, body image issues, family drama, or any of life\u2019s other surprises \u2013 Soluna provides you the space and tools to journey back to yourself.<br><br>You&#39;ll never be asked to make in-app purchases, sign up for a subscription, or tolerate any (annoying) ads. Your only job is to explore your space to the fullest.<br><br>We look forward to moving towards wellness with you here in Soluna \u2013 completely free to download and 100% anonymous. Always.",
